,"idx":null,"text":"聽到獲得冠軍的消息，他「奮不顧身」，在現場又跳又叫","n":25,"ssz":".............1..........."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"答應的事情，如果經常「仰賴」帶過，很快就會失去信任","n":25,"ssz":"11......................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"他的神情「篤定」，面對不公不義的事情他決定勇敢面對","n":25,"ssz":".............1..........."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"根據第六段，教練對阿澤說：「你剛剛反而丟掉了自己最厲害的武器。」這句話的意思是什麼？","n":42,"ssz":".....................................2...."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"阿澤沒有繼續使用速度最快的直球","n":15,"ssz":"..............."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"阿澤沒有發揮自己三振打者的能力","n":15,"ssz":"..............."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"阿澤因為受到干擾，無法專心觀察打者","n":17,"ssz":"...1............."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"阿澤因不信任守備，放棄了擅長的投法","n":17,"ssz":"...1............."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"文章開頭和後段都出現游擊方向的滾地球，作者這樣安排有什麼作用？","n":31,"ssz":"....1.........................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"說明游擊方向是打者們最常攻擊的位置","n":17,"ssz":"................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"用相似情境對照阿澤和小宇前後的改變","n":17,"ssz":".1.......1......."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"強調球場上的滾地球非常容易造成失誤","n":17,"ssz":".1..............."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"表示阿澤仍無法克服對守備失誤的擔心","n":17,"ssz":"................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[3].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"根據本文，下列何者最符合文章主旨？","n":17,"ssz":"................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[3].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,